msgstr "Budite slobodni!"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:85
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KDE is a world-wide community of software engineers, artists, writers, translators and creators who are committed to Free Software development. KDE produces the Plasma desktop environment, hundreds of applications, and the many software libraries that support them.\n"
"\n"
"KDE is a cooperative enterprise: no single entity controls its direction or products. Instead, we work together to achieve the common goal of building the world's finest Free Software. Everyone is welcome to join and contribute to KDE, including you."
msgstr "KDE je svjetska zajednica softverskih inženjera, umjetnika, pisaca, prevoditelja i stvaratelja posvećenih razvoju slobodnog softvera. KDE razvija radno okruženje Plasma, stotine aplikacija i brojne softverske biblioteke koje ih podržavaju.\n\nKDE je zajednički projekt: nijedna pojedinačna organizacija ne upravlja njegovim smjerom ni proizvodima. Zajedno radimo na stvaranju najboljeg slobodnog softvera na svijetu. Svi su dobrodošli pridružiti se KDE-u i doprinositi mu, pa tako i vi."

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:92 formcard/AboutPage.qml:253
#, kde-format
msgid "Homepage"
msgstr "Osobna stranica"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:98
#, kde-format
msgid "Report bugs"
msgstr "Prijava pogrešaka"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:107
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Software can always be improved, and the KDE team is ready to do so. However, you - the user - must tell us when something does not work as expected or could be done better.\n"
"\n"
"KDE has a bug tracking system. Use the button below to file a bug, or use the program's About page to report a bug specific to this application.\n"
"\n"
"If you have a suggestion for improvement then you are welcome to use the bug tracking system to register your wish. Make sure you use the severity called \"Wishlist\"."
msgstr "Softver se uvijek može poboljšati, a KDE-ov tim spreman je to učiniti. No vi, korisnik, morate nam reći kada nešto ne radi kako se očekuje ili bi se moglo poboljšati.\n\nKDE ima sustav za praćenje pogrešaka. Upotrijebite donji gumb za prijavu pogreške ili stranicu „O programu” za prijavu pogreške u ovoj aplikaciji.\n\nAko imate prijedlog za poboljšanje, zabilježite ga u sustavu za praćenje pogrešaka. Odaberite razinu ozbiljnosti „Wishlist”."

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:116
#, kde-format
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Prijavi pogrešku"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Join us"
msgstr "Pridružite nam se"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:127
#, kde-format
msgid "You do not have to be a software developer to be a member of the KDE team. You can join the language teams that translate program interfaces. You can provide graphics, themes, sounds, and improved documentation. You decide!"
msgstr "Ne morate biti programer da biste postali član KDE-ova tima. Možete se pridružiti jezičnim timovima koji prevode sučelja programa, stvarati grafiku, teme i zvukove ili poboljšavati dokumentaciju. Vi odlučujete!"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:132 formcard/AboutPage.qml:277
#, kde-format
msgid "Get Involved"
msgstr "Uključite se"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:139
#, kde-format
msgid "Developer Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentacija za razvojne programere"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:145
#, kde-format
msgid "Support us"
msgstr "Podržite nas"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:151
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KDE software is and will always be available free of charge, however creating it is not free.\n"
"\n"
"To support development the KDE community has formed the KDE e.V., a non-profit organization legally founded in Germany. KDE e.V. represents the KDE community in legal and financial matters.\n"
"\n"
"KDE benefits from many kinds of contributions, including financial. We use the funds to reimburse members and others for expenses they incur when contributing. Further funds are used for legal support and organizing conferences and meetings.\n"
"\n"
"We would like to encourage you to support our efforts with a financial donation.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you very much in advance for your support."
msgstr "KDE-ov softver uvijek je bio i bit će besplatan, ali njegovo stvaranje nije besplatno.\n\nRadi potpore razvoju, KDE-ova zajednica osnovala je KDE e.V., neprofitnu organizaciju registriranu u Njemačkoj. KDE e.V. zastupa KDE-ovu zajednicu u pravnim i financijskim pitanjima.\n\nKDE-u koriste različiti doprinosi, uključujući financijske. Sredstva koristimo za povrat troškova članovima i drugima koji doprinose projektu. Dodatna sredstva namijenjena su pravnoj podršci i organizaciji konferencija i sastanaka.\n\nPozivamo vas da podržite naš rad financijskom donacijom.\n\nUnaprijed vam najljepše zahvaljujemo na podršci."

